{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37787","headline":"谷初忝谏垣今宪长薛公方在西阁知奖隆异以四韵代述荣感 · 郑谷","name":"谷初忝谏垣今宪长薛公方在西阁知奖隆异以四韵代述荣感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧诗常得在高吟，不奈公心爱苦心。\n道自琐闱言下振，恩从仙殿对回深。\n流年渐觉霜欺鬓，至药能教土化金。\n自拂青萍知有地，斋诚旦夕望爲霖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}